nced Skinning System:</strong> Completely customize your gameplay experience with the ability to create skins. Export and share your skins with friends or upload them to the Steam workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Replay System:</strong> Go back in time by watching your previous scores. Watch replays from other players around the world, or export your own and share them with your rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Become a master of Quaver by completing challenges and earning achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>100% Community-Driven:</strong> See your ideas come to life in-game by submitting feature requests and suggestions!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quaver</strong> is a community-driven and open-source competitive rhythm game with two game modes and online leaderboards. Create your own maps, or challenge the world in online multiplayer matches. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fully-featured 4 and 7 key vertically scrolling rhythm game client complete with a sleek and minimalistic user interface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/980610/extras/9ca685640a8a86beb21d7b0ce91b8319.poster.avif?t=1728170196\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/980610/extras/9ca685640a8a86beb21d7b0ce91b8319.webm?t=1728170196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/980610/extras/9ca685640a8a86beb21d7b0ce91b8319.mp4?t=1728170196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong> 